+  - 'L8 progress round 6, still HONEST NULL (2026-07-12, gpt-5.6-sol via codex,
+    round-6 breadth campaign, results/outer_loop_fable5_re86_probe.json):
+    a NEGATIVE finding that rules out a shortcut hypothesis, not new route
